@startuml layer-responsibility-m23
title Artifact #15 (Supporting): Architectural Layer Responsibilities & Cross-Cutting Boundaries
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

package "Layer 1: Presentation (Client Boundaries)" {
    class "Web Learner (Next.js SSR / React)" as PresLearner {
        + Responsibilities:
        -- Render interactive screens (SCR-L-01..14)
        -- Client-side input validation (email, password format)
        -- Local in-app reminder trigger within daily window (ADR-006)
        -- Zero raw JWT storage (httpOnly cookies only)
        -- Handle graceful UI degradation upon service timeouts
    }

    class "Web Admin Portal (lingora-admin)" as PresAdmin {
        + Responsibilities:
        -- Render management consoles (SCR-A-01..11)
        -- Enforce UI role-based view gating
        -- Authoring payload assembly (exercises, media)
        -- Display immutable audit logs and operational metrics
    }
}

package "Layer 2: Application Orchestration (BFF / Route Handlers)" {
    class "Next.js Route Handlers & Server Actions" as AppBFF {
        + Responsibilities:
        -- Cookie session extraction & token forwarding
        -- API routing, request validation, and parameter sanitization
        -- GEC AI proxy orchestration with 8.0s hard timeout
        -- Translate domain errors into standard HTTP error envelopes
        -- Isolate client from direct external service coupling
    }
}

package "Layer 3: Domain Services (Authoritative Business Rules)" {
    class "Domain Logic Services" as DomainLogic {
        + Responsibilities:
        -- Lesson Completion: Own UserProgress completion via UC-05 / BF-10
        -- Controlled Retry: Apply Policy D7 allowance & 70% credit
        -- Placement Mapping: Map 0-30 raw score to English A1 Units (Mapping A)
        -- Conditional Jump: Enforce 24h lockout & >=95% bypass provenance
        -- SRS Scheduling: Apply Policy B intervals [1,3,7,14,30] deterministically
        -- Streak Engine: Evaluate calendar boundary qualifying activity (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh)
        -- Content Lifecycle: Enforce strict SoD (Creator != Mod != Publisher)
        -- Invariant: AI Server is strictly NON-OWNER of all domain states
    }
}

package "Layer 4: Data & External Infrastructure" {
    class "Persistence & External Providers" as DataInfra {
        + Responsibilities:
        -- PostgreSQL PostgREST: Table data persistence with RLS enforcement
        -- Supabase RPC record_review: Atomic transaction boundary for SRS cards
        -- AuditLog Store: Append-only ledger for sensitive admin actions
        -- Supabase GoTrue: Cryptographic JWT issuance (ES256) & session revocation
        -- Supabase Storage: Bucket-level MIME & size policies (lingora-media)
        -- FastAPI AI Server: Stateless T5-small GEC grammar correction inference
    }
}

PresLearner --> AppBFF : HTTP Requests / Cookies
PresAdmin --> AppBFF : HTTP Requests / Cookies
AppBFF --> DomainLogic : Orchestrate Business Operations
DomainLogic --> DataInfra : Read / Write Authorized Records

note right of AppBFF
    Cross-Cutting Security Boundary:
    - Zero client-supplied userIds trusted.
    - auth.uid() derived server-side.
    - AI requests proxied with timeout fallback.
end note

note right of DataInfra
    Transactional Integrity Boundary:
    - record_review executes as single atomic Tx.
    - AssessmentResult is immutable upon insert.
    - AuditLog permits INSERT/SELECT only.
end note

@enduml
